                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/2331: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">McGurk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-09-26T10:00:00-05:00">September 26, 1931—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:37 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>114. For de la Rue from Pixley. Budget as enacted by the Legislature has been
                    submitted to our office.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McGurk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
